# liboqs built (MAYO only) as a CMake subproject when no suitable system
# liboqs is found. Meson downloads the source tarball from source_url on the
# first configure and caches it under subprojects/packagecache/. For builds
# without network access, pre-populate that cache or use a system liboqs.
